{"id":"torrey:witness-of-the-holy-spirit","source":"torrey","name":"Witness Of The Holy Spirit","slug":"witness-of-the-holy-spirit","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is truth — 1Jo 5:6.","refs":[["1John",5,6,5,6]]},{"text":"To be implicitly received — 1Jo 5:6,9.","refs":[["1John",5,6,5,6],["1John",5,9,5,9]]},{"text":"As Messiah. — Lu 3:22; Joh 1:32,33.","refs":[["Luke",3,22,3,22],["John",1,32,1,32],["John",1,33,1,33]]},{"text":"As coming to redeem and sanctify. — 1Jo 5:6.","refs":[["1John",5,6,5,6]]},{"text":"As exalted to be a Prince and Saviour to give repentance, &c. — Ac 5:31,32.","refs":[["Acts",5,31,5,31],["Acts",5,32,5,32]]},{"text":"As perfecting saints. — Heb 10:14,15.","refs":[["Heb",10,14,10,14],["Heb",10,15,10,15]]},{"text":"As foretold by himself. — Joh 15:26.","refs":[["John",15,26,15,26]]},{"text":"In heaven. — 1Jo 5:7,11.","refs":[["1John",5,7,5,7],["1John",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"On earth. — 1Jo 5:8.","refs":[["1John",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"The first preaching of the gospel confirmed by — Ac 14:3; Heb 2:4.","refs":[["Acts",14,3,14,3],["Heb",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"The faithful preaching of the Apostles accompanied by — 1Co 2:4; 1Th 1:5.","refs":[["1Cor",2,4,2,4],["1Thess",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"On believing. — Ac 15:8; 1Jo 5:10.","refs":[["Acts",15,8,15,8],["1John",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"To testify to them of Christ. — Joh 15:26.","refs":[["John",15,26,15,26]]},{"text":"As an evidence of adoption. — Ro 8:16.","refs":[["Rom",8,16,8,16]]},{"text":"As an evidence of Christ in them. — 1Jo 3:24.","refs":[["1John",3,24,3,24]]},{"text":"As an evidence of God in them. — 1Jo 4:13.","refs":[["1John",4,13,4,13]]},{"text":"Borne against all unbelievers — Ne 9:30; Ac 28:25-27.","refs":[["Neh",9,30,9,30],["Acts",28,25,28,27]]}],"refCount":27}
